{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1533,
  "batch_count": 1703,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "e986962879d48100c079e1a81335b9de9e25b281",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7036d14fae9c382a2da3f7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨。……皇冠，有时会\r\n睡眼惺忪地，对我说这句粤语\r\n意思是早安……我好奇便查了一下",
      "source_fingerprint": "926d62f5f169f207549cbcbdf33bcbbc994ff4040425cd9824e66023a91e2071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:942f68996597e42096bcfa9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛理论的报告，写不进规定页数\r\n里……。关于发动进攻的时机，\r\n我还有很多想讨论……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf46e15b2651cc6f6996d389e5281fc19f0b8caf1e836574d83f0d9f7bc3335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14897c39d84a0761e54e78a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来进行一场配得上最强的较量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3583b6dbd9e8eba0064debb6ef6ace4359dc6461e650f976324ee70628fc8bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a74d1aa42f66db331519f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天结束时，反省自己。\r\n是否做到完美，是否有所遗漏\r\n――是否做到了无愧于这血脉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5256ef00da9fef9036bc2a1d7373e5c4b66497eed684647ec9e41ab86eb833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c344a9a9a06201f213d5f82c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去看了进入本格化时期的赛马娘们\r\n的亮相会。――我也\r\n曾那么，青涩吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "b856efe98ef31b8f376665c1a434974c0bf34d3acaa77da90373cc536c17efe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f029d4c047a58875f59b0ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想去高原训练。\r\n凉爽，负荷也高――\r\n山顶的，风景也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04834caa798290bc2e5e1898c6c7fdfc5cfaf00109bf1b7fca6d1516cec506fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b084ee9afddac2f97a875f62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人感伤的季节――原因，\r\n虽不明白……可一旦闲下来，\r\n心里就莫名躁动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "515382d2ab1c8fcbb9526dd2a854f18c5ad15cb8a2e8f7ef83bdc5c2da4a9e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fe8aa36e4f548100e4f093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和姐姐们堆雪人时，是在比赛。\r\n看谁能做出最大的雪球\r\n……要把它们叠起来可费了不少力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dcc3744cbdad8c37b90e72a8fd8c06a9aa5f259805e2d23820d200a4c2d93ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07fa21be108a10b33d7c77c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束后，当我望向你的\r\n训练员室时，看到了亮着的灯光\r\n……让我切身感受到我们正并肩同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20b5e48c2dd5f6740f992e8188a53155ddf9bd1dd9707598d0f8973e191dba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bd3dffa10c3c10441150bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱律前辈她，正沉浸在某种思索\r\n之中。我该不该……上前搭话呢。\r\n会不会打扰到她呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb4280eea0358f14776f3c1c80ff1e87cdad8fece0d5fd376f9279431b84af1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dc214d3e133a20d8945c3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔会看领衔的对练\r\n动作比上次看到时更加利落了\r\n……我也必须，更加勤勉才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6662a61082119290035ad58adbfbef35f5eed93eef7a0c33e48d885cdd7dd4da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c54b9660b10c0adc3e9de57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在国际象棋上赢过统治了。\r\n……不过，那是屡次挑战后才拿下的胜利。\r\n我也必须，多加磨炼才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e4ce954d82b6d32b4d68fe01649e1b9a5c47d0680c9e459010c7d9f150326d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb4c7b9aaab1df1f86c2454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前和标志一起，参观了传统的\r\n建筑物。守护代代传承至今的历史……\r\n让我再一次，感到了肩头沉甸甸的责任",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a536c37a04f92a1a1b0549bf30be074fa512a2e19ef7b7bdde1bfe737e61ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c2569afc3b3c2bb06bc82e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "复习昨天的内容并预习今天的功课。\r\n早起也是为了这个。\r\n身为最强之人，必须文武双全才行",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e5db93359e37469933d31812258eba4c91b54fcbd5ab7c11cb22ecae3e645a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000f3331ca8dd060a1abe0aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "浮标钓、洞钓、轻抛钓\r\n都是我和小高尚去日间垂钓时\r\n听说的技法。真是门深奥的学问啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c4f80ec2e250d2202d0621dae6f4f3e32093934e76fc97f720ee440c9df824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a13fbb7d54fc654eb96887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在就寝前，我一定会彻底做完\r\n拉伸和瑜伽。我想直到一天的\r\n最后一刻都竭尽全力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebb3ca306463bf996e0fb15130fc4133c06b255bb0c8ec2c715a469f85143f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751dfb6eaf32306707580868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生们，都在努力刻苦训练呢。\r\n……正如家族的先辈们曾为我所做的那样，\r\n我也想展现出身为强者的典范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cec2ba05022bac3267f09a6f8179a08386d1720483b5ba0a84ed0fff5b54ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c909f4dfb8ffcac33242d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。为了夺取胜利的计策，\r\n请和我一起想想吧。\r\n……宿舍里，要举办试胆大会了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "540760e2258e34e63546b8bd092e13bf5b64c4f560dc6a313f91f90f60c263a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cec1f56d729c91a07811b78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋，吗。\r\n在学园里大家，也都开心地这么说着。\r\n……下次我也，试着用用看可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cfba814e6cf420f6352fe52d712fcd945ff1d2235eb29ff9b674572fb48fc2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb69e0e3efa19d3afc16c60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火锅很好。一次能摄取多种食材，\r\n营养价值也很高。……若是和谁围坐共食，\r\n还能促成有意义的交流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76cfae0ea46874e88ab04e13246fd21ae4e708c7dc1e4acc949ef00c4532d603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bf92f395cfc2701c5b1483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "德古拉在夜晚拥有无可匹敌的\r\n强大。但我连在白昼也要变得强大，\r\n定要向着真正的最强迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7570e24791d3abd9a52705aee0875ad6f647d501b5bc0e447820aaa1bf40017c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c469817e1fc8b4e2a215c63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣服我经常穿在身上。\r\n因为这是气槽姐和爱律前辈一起\r\n帮我挑选的……珍贵之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a7156f1d540df81720155310eba03a0a9956f981a0b1b74b5ff0019da2280e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7954f0f02cfcbefd3302f9e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。\r\n――为了比任何人都强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd61b0a38a3e047a30eb5eda97782e50e04451513331d1c62673453dd5da26a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c488ea7748569ee54ccf80ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夺取胜利――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82049353eca0dfc1f90b7925b12b6ab1eb8440f3967059bd0a11fb6399279dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e66abc5012fdef5e63bc5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通向最强的道路已经清晰可见。\r\n接下来，只需脚踏实地\r\n一步步走下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1007444878b89ae87cebe3cf8bb32666bcb3573670d763217791fb59b959d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92e3e8f209d9d6a8b14d0fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经提前确认过赛道的情况。\r\n只要得到指示，\r\n就能立即跑起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b09520db443214f5784869461f11113022cf034de59918af0695ed682a3cf05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7ed531c91becaf2f77283f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……似乎有几个人，停下脚步\r\n在看这边。――我不打算\r\n隐藏力量。开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a07d929c22fb576869e5e266e13007b9ffa8d15f338579c70719e1b5f6132b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81743ca4a4893700ed0d1dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丰富的知识与，那份毅力……\r\n如果你是赛马娘，一定会成为\r\n我的强劲对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2b1b6cfae14737e4d44cc2bebd6a0d28c71dd03f9ba13059db735065b11f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd1efa4f355a8e273a4aa667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你，有擅长的运动吗？\r\n……一起跑步虽难做到，不过\r\n若有能一起投入的运动就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7afb2b22c04a58a7568d0fe910018bb2f672cbccef8713aac2468a0892364aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf2c794e152682d62b6bd80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……或许已经成为某种习惯了。\r\n熟悉了这样的光景，自主训练时也，\r\n会叫起不在身边的你……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d556e2d716e869e28539afa17bc426d218dc22ad3862f724b2bf82cd651854b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71dc260780c0690cf488ef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在沙滩上高效训练的方法\r\n我已经记下。为了，尽可能吸收\r\n你安排的训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b63c2d718aaf2938a1b9b4546c24578a5abbe3f8bb5518443fb731edca20d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e83d8779fc81f0028b5bd9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有后辈向我请求说『请收我为眷属吧』\r\n但我该怎么做呢……\r\n对她进行指导就行了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc676d16e45a7e7c3f5c0fdd00022fca4a8efcfd23d89ea888ffdf3cc3900234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506b8ea5901d25a1226ab925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所统御的，并非只有黑夜。\r\n赛场亦当由我统御，\r\n我必须证明这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84676f06e3df256b123f317594274a97d5719916770924bee25835366aa5f0ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:493e362134385c8f47b9fa4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体内流淌的血在躁动。呼唤着要我成为最强。\r\n……为我布置吧。\r\n足以满足这腔热血的，训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef32a4fa1a41468c50cff50101c1fbba9a20773457f04a1cf72a8069af7de29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f20b768b832229a81bd46b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仅仅只是强大，还远远不够。\r\n我的目标是高贵、凛然……\r\n唯有能深深吸引人心，才称得上是最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6cb5f3ab2a79ea0b33b8d85774a311a57f43eec513a7a1712a796aded1953e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a732c402a1aadfa57465b06a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你有什么害怕的事物请告诉我。\r\n我想助你一臂之力去克服它。\r\n……哪怕是幽灵之类的，也没关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3a6c858ce8e0e30ce301ecd3e0c3d3ca08cf617829e2115cbbb7ad581d6e9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b18281d4b72f8d3dff32d0e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让自己的举止更加优雅洗练。\r\n……好让站在我身旁的你，\r\n能够为我感到自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f5ffda362e5fd424656bce38cf080a47af6879fae387b8e55e9ccb81da3001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec4a0c0b5483c18654b809e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在宁静的夜晚，我会想起你的声音。\r\n……想着明天也要继续努力，\r\n体内便会涌现出力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39bfc7297f2fbbe89c40cfc721261c91a98f95bf2733190a86402d2cb7967c34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dca329c65721b28379f894d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想向家族夸耀。这个成绩，以及你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b3e7d1788ca4ff0b5bcebf02a28fb419e75a7ecc4b00cce589f68201d23171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85b01b3eab897640bb78d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是与你一同刻下的功绩。……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c3261c77836ab4a192b7c64de5db96725b4624a1adcee4acb61c22271d344fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e544e70f5c5597875453ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后，纵有万千长夜……只要与你同行就能跨越。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae4eccb3663a59cda353308f97562770383dfc1136a9353840eccbfd1cff73c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0ab23e9a62a81342a37fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连你的心也被我吸引了吗。……太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d06ebcfed04e40a984bd0cf72b3d966c2e4840e28176c3cb65a8b35a821a42b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b61904249ceecd3dabebf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说收集照片的话，谢礼也会增加。嗯……\r\n下一场比赛，我想让你来为我拍。我必将拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91dd1b507b98b3cc4eb62aaa8467f03e80a6b6302baddcec0893fddcd120b589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40227ad5277d32872d8ce08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的协助，看来谢礼也很丰厚。\r\n还有这些照片。……翻看回顾的时间，恐怕会变得很长了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "497a2203f20c2b288557bc3cf75ac43a2b7c0523d4b3118dec5c9ee55432bd0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac05e32d105fadea3b0c647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向高处，再迈向最强――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb2d97bd7b15d8f3205f541792dad98c47b5aa8331d0c424dd1f2c33f5c5309d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353880cdc4e8203792a7278f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须强大。变得，更强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f5ca586d91caa46cfb3b48b89e1631370a8c01fef6fc7c74f5fe3146a7d2f16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:042583ead99553700812d6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，我是大鸣大放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "909cdbe52e7ade109231d7bddb092488e9adeaf44e1e1918407c468caf8560ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c026b329774beedd2108cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂野而，崇高――\r\n展现，最强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c685f175c762fa1a55c5f177c748e1a611835a30bd2a2e921a80c1abb43e2309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11976c28e954f973ee37bac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也，追求力量吗……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e60afd313ac17a8e717b407bc7ed2fe46199611b7f7f8625821b2cd6387caa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb135802d75a8b4f99c3e717",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更加激烈地相互提升吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0e5440eafe668fb30e943923eabc97c61e7f2bd5de77c8dfca0f1adc3c80fec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae17803c00c8ebefb5a1782",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用全新的力量，令众人倾倒吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031dad1816f3db2235b668bae99a309ec0638d29a644240fc9fbbfd7c87f2751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a89a61ef7b943d5fa87a906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭此强大力量，统御整场赛事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5f0a38bb01cb96a9197d61490495ffaa1945de3c426f04d7c1a8cd2c22eb84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af19d5b204e0b4b263c5bc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这夜晚，展现出来吧。\r\n将寄宿于吾血中的，“最强”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4a2925798c0dde4887a8e20c997640947d17d18aef6fe542a9fccaacd33eca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38314874121fcd60836c75b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是大鸣大放。强大、高贵地出征吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "115ac3439e966b8ffcaba9697f57b782c892c79f6bee9fc7ae838635fcf0a045",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2cd74cb30099948e10525c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ef3b7ecf7b554f835c7c37f5680de67f6628381e334b08237939214f949fe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d7b2699d1d497c642019fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你让我见识到的梦想。\r\n今后两人一起去实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ecaf63a9ddcd7b35a372793186193b512afd324e40cb1866fada9562ce0f2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ca8bd611a716f4fef25fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12217a7b0ef6081b84dadb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fa051ce20d52f7fa724f2ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要太勉强自己哦？\r\n……话虽如此，我也不好去说别人，\r\n所以要胡来的时候就让我一起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16adfae80061989d20390bbdb20a43ee33cc5f59dbe2bca7055048f6e60c0081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4238e213dc7e9b16a57a48d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么执着于工作，都是为了我吧。\r\n……那张照片，我会好好珍惜的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b478c08df318ea1f3b9ca437fad4189ff5815e3ce1489347f43a0e39b4310bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47c27a6c2b52600afb9d401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣~~……这样就好了！\r\n元旦日出得到的能量，分你一些哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72655d09b7473fb4b4d9de4b5b000b7182aff490241e9950b5f22583c57fabdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:853d9449524b10989c193238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在巧克力里加入了葵花籽。\r\n这是太阳的恩惠，敬请享用吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b67bfd6b34543e4b91244c00b0e50641917d76fe1990c3ded70caeee0960a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627714225795f19db994452c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是第10个！\r\n终~~于做得够美味了……！\r\n请收下我的巧克力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1aae25471e0db848cdaf2ceb1c65a3e83ee3758e5da468c5c78a78bcd0ef5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b81c6e22a0032b8730589614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新胶枪和棒棒的相机，还希望天气\n多多放晴……啊。写这么多愿望\n好像太贪心了呢，欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9177c5b86eea92e1f62a6d9297333c43cff2e24fd581215b7048d810b55d977b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28194e434c48bca7779c14d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南瓜灯做太多了，\r\n房间变得很恐怖……呜，\r\n回去的话好可怕啊~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dafae98e9223c44a5da48c13b9cd5c68a7abfa68c4c1ab8993c7da04f1db1051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4afac387e4554da152af56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使太阳藏起来了\r\n街道也闪闪发光的！\r\n这样的话，晚上也不会孤单了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "67170c749a339f36653954185a2a059fd1eccfc87d9d86a433e38007b092e25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19eec4166a38d8fe7c2ac387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞训练员。\r\n会早点结束工作吗？\r\n想一起在暖炉边烤烤火呢~",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f441446d7aff9b0c7770ec9b4c1035c498a2846eb9a68fd38ad499b0a8e4c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a0ac40e833265d102cae30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e2b06c5e7805460ed40733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年完成了全力奔跑呢~\r\n明年……还得要全力以赴，\r\n请做好心理准备！呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77fb109da3b0ea0518a2fb5194b7a04243dfb9133a4940cbcf6f4c65eba44a58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53511c4a29f009ab96ae1047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧？\r\n请让我在珍藏的晒太阳之地\r\n为你庆祝吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb4f86392e64d52a5d82b402c2daca1401215e8efefce46163820904bab7cb7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e0936289ef582328e7d9ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要送的礼物是……\r\n手工制作的头冠！\r\n戴上之后，请让我多拍些照片哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c7223f56b2ac0db73220696f3e588fa497b55808d3b16adbbc0dd5d72830bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9131282f902dcfacb32ed9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日~快乐~小~茵~♪……啊，\r\n今天并不是我生日！父母今年也\r\n给我唱了这首歌，所以就……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c1fd4f8f833e7d5192c7c24628eb7daa91bb32bf7b19e1ac72f10c7e2eb90a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2452d9a5cd2dc75d8852428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿~胸口暖暖的。\r\n训练员的那声『恭喜』，\r\n今后也想一直听啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8879eec488b1e08449474c216163b1acd78ceb79551f874b746d30a67ab6b5e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208a0a6d0c7ec4492e38047c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了！\r\n上面写了什么呢……\r\n那个，我可以先看看吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5bc3fa1f9d43a02c9e28a3d9576fa7341e4f7d01325af2b6f857d9a51ca871",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6edf6f0b3e7a60b16c3bca40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物来了！里面一定\r\n充满了各种美好的心意吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc08c0220567708d54d3a9629687ffb914c3ee515e3ab6416ad62127f22af15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85613e9f9bb65834b6364aa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "邦邦咔邦~！任务完成♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42f1b49d5211feecdc2a69f4e6b948247c7c89b9c6abc9714a126392fde8fea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d61669fbaa343eac3e2a41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上要来了哦！\r\n后冠路线的前辈们会来参加吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7871b222c59674842a77f4d525ce4c8a08405e65e32e657f82367e081fb8ead7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea69ed43b5af752eea8e832",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢。\r\n我已经准备完全了！\r\n要尽情享受喽～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9773e28ce2b91c9c0a3a52dba7d4d796e20f319acc2796391435323b74aec30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0c87898251cf137e18fc61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不想放弃啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e10cb59f7b4015da22492ff9050ff8e246928ce285b7b381f19bf7a654b66f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d414d4cc3d2a258ad266aee0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提高了！\r\n恭喜恭喜~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4bad23e1c59ad9624a29de7ca01211971b5283802f8d4432b8bbafd3cb0acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
